That scared me.

359
00:33:20.406 --> 00:33:21.771
But you're okay?

360
00:33:21.773 --> 00:33:24.207
I thought you were
going to hit your head.

361
00:33:24.209 --> 00:33:26.376
♪ Washing is fun ♪

362
00:33:26.378 --> 00:33:27.877
Okay. Whoa. Whoa, whoa.

363
00:33:27.879 --> 00:33:30.380
Hey.
Don't cry.

364
00:33:30.382 --> 00:33:34.217
