same handwriting...

394
00:35:51.489 --> 00:35:55.726
Philip Caruso
from Appleton, Wisconsin.

395
00:35:55.728 --> 00:36:01.498
But you never knew what stamp
was gonna be inside, you know?

396
00:36:01.500 --> 00:36:04.670
So it was...
it was really exciting.

397
00:36:06.339 --> 00:36:08.038
Yeah.

398
00:36:08.040 --> 00:36:11.875
And then he would separate all
his from the ocean-life stamps,

399
00:36:11.877 --> 00:36:13.944
