names and where they came from.

401
00:36:21.686 --> 00:36:23.757
His hands used to shake.

402
00:36:25.023 --> 00:36:30.027
You could see it
when he was mounting the stamps

403
00:36:30.029 --> 00:36:33.831
under the magnifying glass,
you know?

404
00:36:33.833 --> 00:36:36.567
Or you could see it
in his handwriting.

405
00:36:36.569 --> 00:36:39.505
Or you'd hear it
in the ice in his whiskey.

406
00:36:41.773 --> 00:36:44.043
But you would like him, though.

407
00:36:46.112 --> 00:36:49.612
And he would like you.
He would.

408
00:36:49.614 --> 00:36:53.085
Do you think that you would like
to collect stamps? Hmm?

409
00:36:55.054 --> 00:36:58.889
